# Private docs
private/

# Local agent / process scaffolding — design reasoning, plans, and memory that
# must never reach the public surface. Belt-and-suspenders: these are also
# covered by a personal global gitignore on the maintainer's machine, but the
# repo must protect itself for fresh clones, CI, and other contributors.
#
# /plans/ and /memory/ are restored here after being dropped in b5c0e18b. Both
# paths are currently TRACKED SYMLINKS into ../wile-memoplans/, so these two
# patterns are inert today — a tracked path ignores .gitignore. They exist for
# the case the symlinks are ever replaced by real directories, which is measured
# to make 422 of the 430 files in that archive stageable by a bare `git add -A`.
# Protection should rest on a rule, not on a symlink's file mode.
#
# This does NOT retract anything. plans/ and memory/ were tracked as real files
# from 2026-01-17 to 2026-06-11 — 542 paths, 26.5 MiB — and 9225bd32 untracked
# them by renaming to *.local.md, which git recorded as plain deletions, so every
# prior revision keeps its blob. All of it is reachable from origin/master and
# from 45 published tags, is served by 3 forks, and is frozen into immutable
# module zips on proxy.golang.org. It cannot be recalled, and a history rewrite
# would re-SHA 3,885 of 3,911 commits to invalidate 126 of the 127 commit SHAs
# cited in TODO.md and CHANGELOG.md while still not reaching the forks or the
# proxy. Audited 2026-09-26: zero secrets, zero personal data, zero third-party
# confidential material. Going forward is the only direction that works.
/plans/
/memory/
/scheme-corpus/

# Claude Code plugin state: skills scaffolding and the Remember plugin's rolling
# session history. Agent working memory, not a build input, and .remember/ holds
# verbatim session transcripts. Note .goast-beliefs/ is deliberately NOT here —
# its nine belief files are tracked on purpose and are read by wile-goast.
/.superpowers/
/.remember/

